		"description": "<p>With a mystical flourish of your weapon, you briefly create a weak shield of force around a nearby ally. Any creature that attempts to enter the threatened area of your target must make a Strength Save or be unable to enter your target’s threatened area until the start of your next turn. On a successful save, the threatened area is instead treated as difficult terrain.</p>",
